WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.350
Every conversion followed
the order or says why.

3
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:09.190
Every federated credential was checked
against claims captured from a real run,

4
00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:11.863
and passed its exchange
test, before cutover.

5
00:00:11.863 --> 00:00:14.638
Nothing sits in the tenant
that nobody reviewed.

6
00:00:14.638 --> 00:00:18.300
The plan was approved by someone
other than the person who applied it.

7
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:23.454
Every parallel run had thirty clean days,
every disable has the owner's approval,

8
00:00:23.454 --> 00:00:26.812
and nothing was deleted, so
the way back is still open.

9
00:00:26.812 --> 00:00:30.345
Next, Chapter 6 turns to group
managed service accounts,

10
00:00:30.345 --> 00:00:34.262
delegated managed service
accounts, and the Kerberos island.

11
00:00:34.262 --> 00:00:35.420
Thanks for watching.
